Descriptor\":\"Talkthrough:xd381c7f61fccae59\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"xd381c7f61fccae59\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x09cfa153\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6092412598484992\",\"slug\":\"joining-tables-to-themselves-with-self-joins\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Associando tabelas a elas mesmas com self-joins\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/pt/joining-tables-to-themselves-with-self-joins\"},{\"__typename\":\"Challenge\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/pc/challenge-sequels-in-sql\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Challenge:x66d04589e8506e9d\",\"contentKind\":\"Challenge\",\"id\":\"x66d04589e8506e9d\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x09cfa153\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p5692549507448832\",\"slug\":\"challenge-sequels-in-sql\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Desafio: Sequências em SQL\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/pc/challenge-sequels-in-sql\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"sql\"},{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/pt/combining-multiple-joins\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:x7288ba4b305469ab\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"x7288ba4b305469ab\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x09cfa153\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6584936765194240\",\"slug\":\"combining-multiple-joins\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Combinando várias associações\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/pt/combining-multiple-joins\"},{\"__typename\":\"Project\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/pp/project-famous-people\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Project:x53e10587bc4e60e2\",\"contentKind\":\"Project\",\"id\":\"x53e10587bc4e60e2\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x09cfa153\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p5856194908520448\",\"slug\":\"project-famous-people\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNeste projeto você vai criar sua própria tabela com um pequeno conjunto de \\\"pessoas famosas\\\" e então criar mais tabelas sobre coisas que elas fazem e associá-las para criar listas legíveis por humanos.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n    \\u003cp\\u003ePor exemplo, aqui estão tipos de pessoas famosas e as perguntas que seus dados poderiam responder:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n    \\u003cul\\u003e\\n        \\u003cli\\u003eEstrelas de cinema: de que filmes elas participam? São casadas com alguém da lista?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n        \\u003cli\\u003eCantores: que músicas eles compuseram? De onde eles são?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n        \\u003cli\\u003eAutores: que livros eles escreveram?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n        \\u003cli\\u003ePersonagens fictícios: como eles estão relacionados a outros personagens? Em quais livros eles aparecem?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \",\"translatedTitle\":\"Projeto: Pessoas famosas\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/pp/project-famous-people\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"sql\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/a/more-efficient-sql-with-query-planning-and-optimization\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x6d31ca55\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x6d31ca55\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x09cfa153\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax6d31ca55\",\"slug\":\"more-efficient-sql-with-query-planning-and-optimization\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"SQL mais eficiente com otimização e planejamento de consulta\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql/a/more-efficient-sql-with-query-planning-and-optimization\"}],\"id\":\"x09cfa153\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXgwOWNmYTE1Mww\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/relational-queries-in-sql\",\"slug\":\"relational-queries-in-sql\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Aprenda como armazenar dados relacionados em várias tabelas e use junções para agrupá-los (inner joins, outer joins e self joins).\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Consultas relacionais em SQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/a/using-sql-to-update-a-database\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x357ae6d4\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x357ae6d4\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax357ae6d4\",\"slug\":\"using-sql-to-update-a-database\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Usando SQL para atualizar um banco de dados\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/a/using-sql-to-update-a-database\"},{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pt/changing-rows-with-update-and-delete\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:x9dc1daafa9f5bd8c\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"x9dc1daafa9f5bd8c\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p4554973526097920\",\"slug\":\"changing-rows-with-update-and-delete\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Alterando linhas com UPDATE e DELETE\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pt/changing-rows-with-update-and-delete\"},{\"__typename\":\"Challenge\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pc/challenge-dynamic-documents\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Challenge:xa501d451a399dc78\",\"contentKind\":\"Challenge\",\"id\":\"xa501d451a399dc78\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p5079078922878976\",\"slug\":\"challenge-dynamic-documents\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Desafio: Documentos dinâmicos\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pc/challenge-dynamic-documents\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"sql\"},{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pt/altering-tables-after-creation\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:xb74c5b43f042bc56\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"xb74c5b43f042bc56\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6560950475948032\",\"slug\":\"altering-tables-after-creation\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Alterando tabelas após sua criação\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pt/altering-tables-after-creation\"},{\"__typename\":\"Challenge\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pc/challenge-clothing-alterations\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Challenge:xe1ef4b2d5cd67462\",\"contentKind\":\"Challenge\",\"id\":\"xe1ef4b2d5cd67462\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p4651461677678592\",\"slug\":\"challenge-clothing-alterations\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Desafio: Alterações de vestimenta\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pc/challenge-clothing-alterations\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"sql\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/a/make-your-sql-safer\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:xed476b0a\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"xed476b0a\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"axed476b0a\",\"slug\":\"make-your-sql-safer\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Torne seu SQL mais seguro\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/a/make-your-sql-safer\"},{\"__typename\":\"Project\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pp/project-app-impersonator\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Project:x10f2bbc78cfe836a\",\"contentKind\":\"Project\",\"id\":\"x10f2bbc78cfe836a\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6140742934331392\",\"slug\":\"project-app-impersonator\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePense em seus aplicativos preferidos e escolha um que armazena seus dados, por exemplo um jogo que armazena pontuação, um aplicativo que permite que você publique atualizações, etc.\\n        Neste projeto você vai imaginar que o aplicativo armazena seus dados em um banco de dados SQL (o que é muito provável!) e escrever instruções SQL que poderiam ser as usadas pelo aplicativo.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n        \\u003cul\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ccode\\u003eCREATE\\u003c/code\\u003e - crie uma tabela para armazenar os dados.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003e\\u003ccode\\u003eINSERT\\u003c/code\\u003e - insira algumas linhas de exemplo na tabela.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003eUse an \\u003ccode\\u003eUPDATE\\u003c/code\\u003e - atualize para simular o que acontece quando você edita os dados no aplicativo.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n            \\u003cli\\u003eUse a \\u003ccode\\u003eDELETE\\u003c/code\\u003e - apague para simular o que acontece quando você exclui os dados no aplicativo.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n        \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n    \\n \",\"translatedTitle\":\"Projeto: App personificador\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql/pp/project-app-impersonator\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"sql\"}],\"id\":\"xa052ff48\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXhhMDUyZmY0OAw\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/modifying-databases-with-sql\",\"slug\":\"modifying-databases-with-sql\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Aprenda a atualizar e excluir dados e a alterar esquemas de tabelas com os comandos SQL UPDATE, DELETE, ALTER e DROP.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Modificando bancos de dados com SQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/further-learning-in-sql/a/further-learning-in-sql-what-to-learn-next\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x35ceecf3\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x35ceecf3\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x587ded53\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax35ceecf3\",\"slug\":\"further-learning-in-sql-what-to-learn-next\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"O que aprender a seguir\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/further-learning-in-sql/a/further-learning-in-sql-what-to-learn-next\"}],\"id\":\"x587ded53\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXg1ODdkZWQ1Mww\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql/further-learning-in-sql\",\"slug\":\"further-learning-in-sql\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Tenha ideias de como você pode continuar aprendendo mais sobre SQL e bancos de dados.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Aprendizagem futura em SQL\"}],\"iconPath\":\"https://cdn.kastatic.org/genfiles/topic-icons/icons/databases.png-776f54-128c.png\",\"id\":\"xcffdaa1f\",\"isListedForLearners\":true,\"learnableContentSummary\":{\"__typename\":\"LearnableContentSummary\",\"countExercises\":0},\"masteryEnabled\":false,\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/sql\",\"slug\":\"sql\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Aprenda a usar SQL para armazenar, consultar e manipular dados. SQL é uma linguagem de programação com um propósito especial, projetada para manipular dados em um banco de dados relacional e é usada por um grande número de aplicativos e organizações.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Introdução a SQL: Consulta e gerenciamento de dados\",\"unlistedAncestorIds\":null},{\"__typename\":\"Unit\",\"allOrderedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Video\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/intro-games-visualizations/v/welcome-games-visualizations\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Video:x25e24ff2\",\"contentKind\":\"Video\",\"id\":\"x25e24ff2\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x1dd579f7\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"vx25e24ff2\",\"slug\":\"welcome-games-visualizations\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"JavaScript pode ser usada para criar jogos e visualizações incríveis. Elas podem incluir componentes como controles de IU (Interface de Usuário) e de teclado, cenas, personagens, ambientes, itens, deteção de colisão e pontuação. Vamos explorar cada um desses componentes em detalhe enquanto criamos nossos próprios jogos e visualizações nesta unidade!\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Introdução a Jogos e Visualizações\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/intro-games-visualizations/v/welcome-games-visualizations\"}],\"id\":\"x1dd579f7\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXgxZGQ1NzlmNww\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/intro-games-visualizations\",\"slug\":\"intro-games-visualizations\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Um rápido tour pelos componentes de jogos e de visualizações, feito a partir da demonstração de alguns dos nossos programas preferidos.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Introdução a Jogos \\u0026 Visualizações\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-scenes/a/what-are-scenes\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x22470f6b\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x22470f6b\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d37566a\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax22470f6b\",\"slug\":\"what-are-scenes\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"O que são cenas?\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-scenes/a/what-are-scenes\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-scenes/a/animated-scenes\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x41310aec\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x41310aec\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d37566a\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax41310aec\",\"slug\":\"animated-scenes\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Cenas animadas\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-scenes/a/animated-scenes\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-scenes/a/interactive-scenes\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x3bf16a6f\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x3bf16a6f\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d37566a\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax3bf16a6f\",\"slug\":\"interactive-scenes\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Cenas interativas\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-scenes/a/interactive-scenes\"}],\"id\":\"x7d37566a\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXg3ZDM3NTY2YQw\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-scenes\",\"slug\":\"programming-scenes\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Aprenda como alternar entre múltiplas cenas no seu programa, mesmo que elas sejam animadas ou interativas.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Gerenciamento de cena\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/a/what-are-buttons\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:xaf8fe278\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"xaf8fe278\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x11e9f299\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"axaf8fe278\",\"slug\":\"what-are-buttons\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"O que são botões?\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/a/what-are-buttons\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/a/a-button-function\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x8dffd9bd\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x8dffd9bd\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x11e9f299\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax8dffd9bd\",\"slug\":\"a-button-function\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Uma função botão\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/a/a-button-function\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/a/a-button-object-type\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x1f1cd8f4\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x1f1cd8f4\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x11e9f299\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax1f1cd8f4\",\"slug\":\"a-button-object-type\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Um objeto do tipo Button\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/a/a-button-object-type\"},{\"__typename\":\"Challenge\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/pc/challenge-rabbit-racer\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Challenge:x121bf9b0a81ed490\",\"contentKind\":\"Challenge\",\"id\":\"x121bf9b0a81ed490\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x11e9f299\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p5904795440775168\",\"slug\":\"challenge-rabbit-racer\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Desafio: Corrida de coelhos\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons/pc/challenge-rabbit-racer\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"pjs\"}],\"id\":\"x11e9f299\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXgxMWU5ZjI5OQw\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-buttons\",\"slug\":\"programming-buttons\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Aprenda como criar botões clicáveis que sejam fáceis de customizar para os seus programas.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Botões\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/intro-to-hoppy-beaver\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x49beb8f2\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x49beb8f2\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xb5ef4c84\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax49beb8f2\",\"slug\":\"intro-to-hoppy-beaver\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Introdução ao Castor Saltitante\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/intro-to-hoppy-beaver\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/beaver-character\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:xaf3db80f\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"xaf3db80f\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xb5ef4c84\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"axaf3db80f\",\"slug\":\"beaver-character\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"O personagem castor\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/beaver-character\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/forest-environment\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x7715d6eb\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x7715d6eb\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xb5ef4c84\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax7715d6eb\",\"slug\":\"forest-environment\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Ambiente da floresta\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/forest-environment\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/stick-collisions\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x610fd387\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x610fd387\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xb5ef4c84\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax610fd387\",\"slug\":\"stick-collisions\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Colisões com as varetas\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/stick-collisions\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/scoring-and-winning\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x833dc4a3\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x833dc4a3\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xb5ef4c84\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax833dc4a3\",\"slug\":\"scoring-and-winning\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Pontuando e vencendo o jogo\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/a/scoring-and-winning\"},{\"__typename\":\"Project\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/pp/project-hoppy-beaver-extreme\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Project:x912d4ebb78d1fdcc\",\"contentKind\":\"Project\",\"id\":\"x912d4ebb78d1fdcc\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xb5ef4c84\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p4893812990148608\",\"slug\":\"project-hoppy-beaver-extreme\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eJá vimos a versão mais básica deste jogo, e pra falar a verdade, ela também é muito fácil. Agora que você já sabe como ele funciona, tente fazê-lo ficar mais difícil e interessante. Aqui estão algumas ideias que você pode usar:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n  \\u003cul\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eInverta o mecanismo de colisão - faça com que o castor tenha que passar pelo buraco, sem tocar as bordas.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eAdicione obstáculos que diminuam a pontuação - como gravetos do mal ou buracos no chão.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eAdicione personagens que ataquem o castor e que tenham seus movimentos previamente programados.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eFaça vários níveis, e faça com que a dificuldade aumente a cada nível (como novos tipos de obstáculos).\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eAdicione uma mensagem legal para quando o usuário completar o jogo.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \",\"translatedTitle\":\"Projeto: Hopper o Castor, Versão Extrema\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller/pp/project-hoppy-beaver-extreme\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"pjs\"}],\"id\":\"xb5ef4c84\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXhiNWVmNGM4NAw\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/side-scroller\",\"slug\":\"side-scroller\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Aprenda a fazer um jogo simples em 2D, no qual você aperta uma tecla para controlar o castor e ajudá-lo a coletar varetas suficientes para construir sua toca. Você pode facilmente aprimorar esse jogo para fazer seu próprio jogo no estilo \\\"Flappy Bird\\\"!\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Criando um jogo em 2D: Hoppy, o Castor Saltitante\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/intro-to-memory\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x0a274f09\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x0a274f09\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xbf6ce853\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax0a274f09\",\"slug\":\"intro-to-memory\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Introdução ao \\\"Jogo da Memória\\\"\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/intro-to-memory\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/grid-of-tiles\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x596b3048\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x596b3048\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xbf6ce853\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax596b3048\",\"slug\":\"grid-of-tiles\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Jogo da memória: desenhando uma grade de peças\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/grid-of-tiles\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/playing-the-game\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x608a6d79\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x608a6d79\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xbf6ce853\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax608a6d79\",\"slug\":\"playing-the-game\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Jogo da memória: virando peças\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/playing-the-game\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/memory-game-scoring-and-winning\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:xc76e409c0e15f855\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"xc76e409c0e15f855\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xbf6ce853\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"axc76e409c0e15f855\",\"slug\":\"memory-game-scoring-and-winning\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Jogo da memória: pontuando e vencendo\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/a/memory-game-scoring-and-winning\"},{\"__typename\":\"Project\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/pp/project-memory\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Project:xd62c01fe8125e616\",\"contentKind\":\"Project\",\"id\":\"xd62c01fe8125e616\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"xbf6ce853\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6369047752998912\",\"slug\":\"project-memory\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\" \\u003cp\\u003eVocê viu como gerar um \\\"Jogo da Memória\\\" básico, mas você pode fazer muito mais. Melhore o jogo, usando suas próprias ideias ou algumas das que listamos abaixo:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n  \\u003cul\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eAdicione um estado de suspensão às peças, assim elas mudam de cor quando você deixar o mouse sobre elas.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eAdicione um timer ao jogo, assim parte da pontuação levará em conta o tempo que o jogador demorar para jogar.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eFaça uma tela de vitória mais legal - que tal algo como todas as peças descendo em cascata pela tela?\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003ePermita que o jogador possa começar um novo jogo clicando em um botão, ou invés de ter de reiniiciar.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eDê a opção do jogador escolher o tamanho do tabuleiro.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n    \\u003cli\\u003eImplemente um modo de jogo para dois jogadores -no qual o segundo jogador é controlado por programação (o programa escolhe as peças de forma aleatória  ou inteligente), ou controlado manualmente (se houver dois jogadores na frente do mesmo computador).\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003c/ul\\u003e\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Projeto: Jogo da Memória++\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game/pp/project-memory\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"pjs\"}],\"id\":\"xbf6ce853\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXhiZjZjZTg1Mww\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/memory-game\",\"slug\":\"memory-game\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Você já jogou aquele jogo que você precisa virar as cartas e tentar encontrar os pares? Aprenda a programar uma versão digital do jogo!\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Programando um Jogo da Memória\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-transformations/a/translation\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:xa08d1f64\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"xa08d1f64\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x896e6e88\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"axa08d1f64\",\"slug\":\"translation\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Tradução\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-transformations/a/translation\"},{\"__typename\":\"Challenge\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-transformations/pc/challenge-translation-salvation\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Challenge:xa5177f674f6fee46\",\"contentKind\":\"Challenge\",\"id\":\"xa5177f674f6fee46\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x896e6e88\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x89af0e82\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p4678769230086144\",\"slug\":\"challenge-translation-salvation\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Desafio: salvação de tradução\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/programming-games-visualizations/programming-transformations/pc/challenge-translation-salvation\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"pjs\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\