Enabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax70626fce\",\"slug\":\"dom-events-and-properties\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Quais são as propriedades e os eventos DOM?\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery/a/dom-events-and-properties\"},{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery/pt/checking-dom-readiness-with-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:x449e101ec491dea8\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"x449e101ec491dea8\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3ebb01eb\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p5019614913363968\",\"slug\":\"checking-dom-readiness-with-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Saiba como usar jQuery para verificar se a página está completamente carregada antes de tentar acessar e modificar o DOM.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Verificação de disponibilidade de DOM com jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery/pt/checking-dom-readiness-with-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery/a/review-dom-events-in-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x4628563e\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x4628563e\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3ebb01eb\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax4628563e\",\"slug\":\"review-dom-events-in-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Revisão: Eventos DOM em jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery/a/review-dom-events-in-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Project\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery/pp/project-scene-change\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Project:x9b43156528097bf5\",\"contentKind\":\"Project\",\"id\":\"x9b43156528097bf5\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3ebb01eb\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6646278447562752\",\"slug\":\"project-scene-change\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026\\u003eNesse projeto, você vai criar uma cena interativa usando\\u0026nbsp;imagens HTML, posicionamento CSS e eventos jQuery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cp\\u003eComece fazendo alguma coisa quando o usuário clicar no avatar do Leafers na página web. Você poderia alterar a imagem (como para uma versão mais antiga do Leafers), reproduzir um som (\\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.khanacademy.org/computer-programming/example-playing-sound-on-click/6617772749619200\\\"\\u003eveja exemplo\\u003c/a\\u003e), fazer aparecer uma div que se parece com um balão de diálogo - algo desse tipo!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cp\\u003eEntão, adicione pelo menos mais 2 elementos interativos que variam quando o usuário clica neles\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cp\\u003eNão gosta da praia ou do Leafers? Fique à vontade para alterar as imagens iniciais se quiser. Divirta-se!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Projeto: Alteração de cena\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery/pp/project-scene-change\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"webpage\"}],\"id\":\"x3ebb01eb\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXgzZWJiMDFlYgw\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-events-with-jquery\",\"slug\":\"dom-events-with-jquery\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Saiba como usar jQuery para adicionar listeners de evento a elementos, para que você possa responder quando usuários clicarem, apertarem teclas, deslizarem, arrastarem, e mais.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Eventos DOM com jQuery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/a/process-forms-with-jquery-intro\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x6c308a79\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x6c308a79\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x74d9f5a2\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax6c308a79\",\"slug\":\"process-forms-with-jquery-intro\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Por que processar formulários com jQuery?\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/a/process-forms-with-jquery-intro\"},{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/pt/processing-a-quiz-with-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:xdd62e30a0c6daabd\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"xdd62e30a0c6daabd\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x74d9f5a2\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p5387081839935488\",\"slug\":\"processing-a-quiz-with-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Saiba como usar jQuery para processar um questionário simples, verificando se o usuário entrou com a resposta correta e informando o resultado.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Processamento de questionário com jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/pt/processing-a-quiz-with-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/pt/more-form-processing-with-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:x502ba65b4466246f\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"x502ba65b4466246f\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x74d9f5a2\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6267650798911488\",\"slug\":\"more-form-processing-with-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Aprenda mais técnicas para processar formulários com jQuery, como seletores de atributo de escopo.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Mais sobre processamento de formulários com jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/pt/more-form-processing-with-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/a/review-processing-forms-with-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x2a7e8710\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x2a7e8710\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x74d9f5a2\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax2a7e8710\",\"slug\":\"review-processing-forms-with-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Revisão: Processamento de formulários com jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/a/review-processing-forms-with-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Project\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/pp/project-word-game\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Project:x9a3ff96089ce4488\",\"contentKind\":\"Project\",\"id\":\"x9a3ff96089ce4488\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x74d9f5a2\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6519423048482816\",\"slug\":\"project-word-game\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNós começamos nossa página com um jogo de palavras clássico - o jogador vê uma palavra embaralhada, digita o que ele acha que é e ganha se acertar. Neste projeto, seu objetivo é incluir o código jQuery necessário para implementar essa lógica. Quando você conseguir fazer isso funcionar, acrescente mais palavras, formate a mensagem de vitória ou derrota, e faça o que mais você achar que o jogo precisa.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cp\\u003eNote que se você tentar submeter o formulário agora, a saída irá redirecionar para uma tela em branco e você vai precisar recarregar esta página. Quando você acrescentar o JavaScript para interceptar a submissão do formulário, você pode indicar para o navegador que não é mais para redirecionar.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Projeto: Jogo de palavras \",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery/pp/project-word-game\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"webpage\"}],\"id\":\"x74d9f5a2\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXg3NGQ5ZjVhMgw\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/form-processing-jquery\",\"slug\":\"form-processing-jquery\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Saiba como usar jQuery para processar formulários no navegador, como para fazer questionários ou jogos.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Processamento de formulários com jQuery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pt/animating-visibility-with-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:x9e51a99255186e74\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"x9e51a99255186e74\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3e694126\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6463982350237696\",\"slug\":\"animating-visibility-with-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Saiba como usar jQuery para mostrar, ocultar e alternar elementos com efeitos de animação.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Animação de visibilidade com jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pt/animating-visibility-with-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Challenge\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pc/challenge-sliding-snake\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Challenge:xf220e70ab3af37c8\",\"contentKind\":\"Challenge\",\"id\":\"xf220e70ab3af37c8\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3e694126\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6671525890621440\",\"slug\":\"challenge-sliding-snake\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Desafio: Cobra deslizante\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pc/challenge-sliding-snake\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"webpage\"},{\"__typename\":\"Talkthrough\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pt/animating-numeric-properties-with-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Talkthrough:x45b7653c4d25c6fd\",\"contentKind\":\"Talkthrough\",\"id\":\"x45b7653c4d25c6fd\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3e694126\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p6370431520079872\",\"slug\":\"animating-numeric-properties-with-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Saiba como usar jQuery para animar elementos de forma personalizada, como animar seus tamanhos, bordas e espaçamento com quaisquer valores que você especificar.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Animação de propriedades numéricas com jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pt/animating-numeric-properties-with-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/a/review-dom-animation-in-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:xc8da8162\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"xc8da8162\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3e694126\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"axc8da8162\",\"slug\":\"review-dom-animation-in-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Revisão: Animação DOM em jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/a/review-dom-animation-in-jquery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Project\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pp/project-interactive-slideshow\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Project:x056e885fa44bdf61\",\"contentKind\":\"Project\",\"id\":\"x056e885fa44bdf61\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x3e694126\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"p5520071180025856\",\"slug\":\"project-interactive-slideshow\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNeste projeto, você vai usar jQuery para criar uma apresentação de slides interativa com várias imagens e transições animadas.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cp\\u003eNeste momento essa página web só tem uma imagem e um botão \\u0026quot;Próximo\\u0026quot;  que não funciona. Para começar, descubra como fazer o botão \\u0026quot;Próximo\\u0026quot; funcionar\\u0026nbsp;para exibir outra imagem. Então, adicione um botão \\u0026quot;Anterior\\u0026quot; que mostra a imagem anterior.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003cp\\u003eQuando tudo estiver funcionando, deixe isso mais atrativo! Faça a transição de imagens usando efeitos jQuery ou animações, adicione alguns estilos CSS (ou uma ferramenta como \\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.khanacademy.org/computer-programming/css-library-example-bootstrap/4697699761913856\\\"\\u003eBootstrap\\u003c/a\\u003e) para fazer com que as imagens e o botão pareçam lisos e adicione legendas para que os usuários saibam o que as imagens significam. Você também pode tentar carregar as imagens apenas quando precisar delas -- assim o navegador do usuário só vai gastar a banda da internet carregando\\u0026nbsp;imagens que eles realmente vão olhar.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Projeto: Apresentação de slides interativa\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery/pp/project-interactive-slideshow\",\"userAuthoredContentType\":\"webpage\"}],\"id\":\"x3e694126\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9waWMiCXgzZTY5NDEyNgw\",\"relativeUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/dom-animation-with-jquery\",\"slug\":\"dom-animation-with-jquery\",\"translatedDescription\":\"Saiba como usar jQuery para animar elementos com efeitos como desvanecer e deslizar.\",\"translatedTitle\":\"Animação DOM e efeitos com jQuery\"},{\"__typename\":\"Lesson\",\"curatedChildren\":[{\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"canonicalUrl\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/further-learning-jquery/a/what-to-learn-after-jquery\",\"contentDescriptor\":\"Article:x34b1c0df\",\"contentKind\":\"Article\",\"id\":\"x34b1c0df\",\"parentTopic\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x14b5a3a3\",\"parent\":{\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"id\":\"x7d10e7ab\",\"masteryEnabled\":false}},\"progressKey\":\"ax34b1c0df\",\"slug\":\"what-to-learn-after-jquery\",\"translatedCustomTitleTag\":\"\",\"translatedDescription\":\"\",\"translatedTitle\":\"O que aprender depois de jQuery\",\"urlWithinCurationNode\":\"/computing/computer-programming/html-js-jquery/further-learning-jquery/a/what-to-learn-after-jquery\"}],\"id\":\"x14b5a3a3\",\"key\":\"ag5zfmtoYW4tYWNhZGVteXIUCxIFVG9wa